  <ScenTitle>Wooden Leg, 1985</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Original Concept By:&lt;/B&gt; Ragnar Emsoy&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; October 1st 1985 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Mediterranean &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; Israel &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 13 Hours&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;In response to IDF forces apprehending a known senior commander, PLO Force 17 operatives hijacked a small Israeli yacht and executed 3 Israeli citizens. Israel responds by conducting a surprise early morning air raid on PLO infrastructure in what is thought to be a safe haven, Tunisia.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
